---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { href, REFERENCES_REPO_URL, sourcePdfUrl } from '../../lib/site'

const sections = [
  {
    href: '/document/introduction',
    title: '1 — Introduction',
    pages: 'PDF pp. 9–13',
    desc: 'Scope, sources and volumes; references; definitions; abbreviations; how the Directory is organized.',
  },
  {
    href: '/document/maintenance',
    title: '2 — Maintenance of the TDED',
    pages: 'PDF pp. 14–18',
    desc: 'The TDED Maintenance Agency: composition, procedures for adding, changing and withdrawing data elements.',
  },
  {
    href: '/document/presentation',
    title: '4.1 — Presentation of data elements',
    pages: 'PDF pp. 20–27',
    desc: 'The printed anatomy of an entry: headers, the change-indicator legend, character representation, categories.',
  },
]
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The document — UN/TDED"
  description="The original documentation of UNTDED 2005 (ECE/TRADE/362, ISO 7372:2005): introduction, maintenance procedures, and the presentation rules — transcribed onto the site."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-un-deep">The document</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">The original text, on the site</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-body">
      The element entries are the Directory’s main part, but the publication
      documents itself first: what it covers, who maintains it, and how an
      entry is built. Those sections are transcribed here so the registry
      carries its own documentation. Section 3 (Indexes) is reserved for
      future use in the source; the 1504 entries of section 4.2 are the{' '}
      <a class="text-un-deep underline decoration-un/50" href={href('/elements')}>directory</a>{' '}
      itself.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-3">
      {
        sections.map((s) => (
          <a
            href={href(s.href)}
            class="block rounded-md border border-line bg-paper p-5 transition-colors hover:border-un/60"
          >
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
              <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">{s.title}</h2>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-body">{s.pages}</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body">{s.desc}</p>
          </a>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8">
      <a href={sourcePdfUrl()} class="block rounded-md border border-line bg-paper p-5 transition-colors hover:border-un/60">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink">Read the source PDF ↗</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body">
          The full publication — <span class="font-mono text-xs">UNTDED2005.pdf</span> (132 pp,
          ECE/TRADE/362 = ISO 7372:2005), hosted on this site. Every element
          entry links to its page in it.
        </p>
      </a>
    </div>  </div>
</BaseLayout>
